Zurkrieg
========

*"Come, have at you! I will show you what real strength is!"*

*A self-made tycoon and fighter who hunts the world's most powerful people to recruit or destroy them.*

**Background**

Grant Zurkrieg grew up poor in Europe and has craved power ever
since. A gift for economics made him a millionaire by his
mid-twenties; when money wasn't enough, he built his body into a
fighting machine, and that wasn't enough either. Now his Men in
Black scour the world for its most powerful people, so that he
can make them join him or crush them.

**Character Hooks**

Anyone with remarkable skill or power can catch Zurkrieg's eye,
and his lavishly funded experiments can cause trouble of their
own -- as in Ai's and Yuu's backgrounds.

